nciliation.\n- Validation evidence (pass/fail per check, environment details, defects\n  found) is documented; any culler defect observed at 8 hours is fixed within\n  this epic and re-validated.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-1 (P1): The default idle culling timeout for newly installed clusters\n  is 8 hours instead of 24 (culler-side validation that the 8-hour value is\n  enforced correctly).\n\n## Notes\n\n- This validation can run in parallel with the shipped-default change: the\n  culler is configurable today, so the 8-hour value is set directly through\n  existing configuration surfaces rather than waiting for the new default to\n  ship.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":31984,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b854c6fd2bba62ba","agent_id":"af078f7b2e346bbd2","session_id":"ba0e710c-819a-4430-9b1f-ad9788382ed4","uuid":"4f582765-d12b-42e1-bcbc-a02fad92724f","timestamp":"2026-10-22T17:32:04.784Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9003"}
